# Development only. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored); never commit the copy.
# With the DB-IP database from `pnpm fetch:dbip`, `pnpm dev` runs the forecast service and
# looks up this public address so the TV Guide shows weather locally. Use your own public
# address for your own city, or any public address (8.8.8.8 is Mountain View).
FORECAST_DEV_IP=
